 "plan": {
  "value": {
   "primary": "Rats into a Snail: every Rat entering creates or grows one Snail, and Wick's {U}{B}{R}, sacrifice a Snail deals its power to each opponent and draws that many. Type-changers (Arcane Adaptation, Leyline of Transformation, Maskwood Nexus) make the Snail a Rat, so it loops with free outlets.",
   "secondary": "Grow the Snail with Bulk Up, Lich's Relic and Blade of the Bloodchief, keep counters with The Ozolith, and run Marrow-Gnawer + Intruder Alarm; Tainted Strike turns Wick's damage into poison."
